- The model's facts (Ollama library page, read 2026-11-21): Thinking Machines, 26B params / 5.4B active MoE, 12 of 24 layers looped 3x per token, trained and shipped natively in NVFP4, Apache 2.0. Ollama's package ships macOS + DGX Spark manifests only — no linux/amd64.
