# Operation Salvage MTTD: track mean time to delivery on the tiny outreach tasks and improve it

Coordinate: 17.6.10/7.7.10/5.6.8
Issued: 2026-11-14
Request (verbatim): Track mean time to delivery for Operation Salvage's tiny outreach tasks (T0 = Will's opening message, T1 = first complete deliverable in his hands, seconds) in a standing ledger, state delivery time + running MTTD on each delivery, and work on improving it.
Status: in_progress

Notes:
- Will, 2026-11-14 11:29 CST: 'as I do these tiny outreach tasks, track our mean time to delivery and focus on improving it'; 11:30: 'seconds matter at this scale.'
- Definition: T0 = Will's message opening a task; T1 = the message that first puts the complete deliverable in his hands; duration in seconds; MTTD = mean over tasks. Ledger: ~/workspace/operation-salvage/mttd.md. Every delivery message in the operation states its own delivery time and the running MTTD.
- Sub-task of the Operation Salvage umbrella 29.5.9/7.7.12/6.5.9. Backfill from the Moots transcript dispatched 2026-11-14.
