- Will via the edit.phext.io chat, 2026-11-10: the park on the training video (placed 2026-11-10 00:04 for MCP access) is lifted. Operative plan: PRODUCTION-PLAN.md section 6 polish tier; script WALKTHROUGH.md; narration narration-full.mp3 (364.2 s, Emise/Aria at 100% speed per Will 2026-11-09).
- GATE 0 VERIFIED 2026-11-10: signed-out Playwright session on aletheia-core loaded https://edit.phext.io/wiki/#1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.1 — the 49-scroll encyclopedia renders with NO sign-in wall (info banner only: 'Read it freely — nothing here is saved'). Evidence: production/captures/verify-wiki-public-2026-11-10.png (SHA-256 e980a7b2eb4ca9baf655ee98ca7d90693eec6f064dbcb8c47c7b8aa3f6913b2f). Supersedes the 2026-11-09 23:38 wall finding (phext-lattice PR #51 public-wiki fix is live).
- CAPTURE: animated beats (01, 04, 05, 06, 11) recorded from the LIVE public wiki with Playwright on aletheia-core — eased cursor paths, big 76px cursor ring, 150% zoom; beat 05's instant coordinate jump bridged with a 0.4 s crossfade, logged as post-smoothed. Beat 06 used the editor's own search sheet (Plan A): 'centuries' typed, result clicked, Oak landing verified. Beat 09 is a real asciinema terminal recording of the rehearsed query_demo.py sequence on a scratch copy (asciinema 2.4.0 + agg 1.5.0), tail freeze-held ~4.8 s to slot length.
- ASSEMBLY on aletheia-core under thermal gates (segments started <=70 C Tctl): 12 segments at exact TIMING.md durations; narration loudnormed two-pass (target -14 LUFS; measured on the finished file: -14.51 LUFS integrated, -0.66 dBTP). Full per-beat source map + gaps: production/ROUGH-CUT-LOG.md.
- OPEN: beat 07 signed-in edit+save take (production/BEAT-07-ONETAKE.md — written and source-verified: green 'Save (Ctrl+S)' button, Honeybee summary 1.1.1/2.1.1/1.1.1, same replacement line as beat 09's rehearsal); beat 12 Scrolltown key frame (no register frame exists; register lock due 2026-12-04); beat 08 primary download path does not exist on the site (fallback footage used, logged); graphics-package assets (title card, stack motion graphics, callouts, text card) replace drawtext/slate versions at polish; Gate 1 narration listen still gates release.

