Notes:
- RECON (2026-11-18): the linked tweet (2026-11-18 16:31 CST) is Booch quote-posting his own 16:21 post about a DOGE assignee to air traffic control — in his words the man was void of domain understanding, uncaring about the architecture of the current system, inexperienced in hard real-time/high-risk systems whose failure could result in human death. Booch's capstone line: 'Do not mansplain the Deep Magic to me; I was there when it was written.' Substance: an architecture elder defending life-critical real-time systems against ignorant disruption. Resonance for Will: EFJ/LMR is exactly that system class; Booch's 'I was there' is the receipts posture; architecture-as-accumulated-domain-understanding is the Exocortex thesis. PLAN presented to Will 2026-11-18: (1) substantive in-thread reply from Will's public-safety real-time seat — peer signal, no pitch (drafts for Will's approval, nothing sent); (2) the slower door — Computing: The Human Experience companion book (his current focus; Will's 2026-11-12 open thread: help him finish it); (3) the persona-claim artifact held until a live exchange resumes; (4) grown-not-forced cadence throughout.
