Coordinate: 19.14.16/11.6.14/5.10.7
Issued: 2026-11-15 15:40 CST
Request (verbatim): Per-domain checklist for consolidating all 16 domains at NearlyFreeSpeech: current registrar, expiry, DNS hosting verified from a ranch node, NFSN inbound TLD support verified (.io/.us/.me open question from the 2026-11-06 inventory), lock windows, ordered steps with Will's clicks enumerated. Source inventory: ~/workspace/your_files/domain-inventory-and-streamlining-2026-11-06.md. exectorox.com first (Squarespace lock-in deadline 2026-12-04, register #42).
Status: Dispatched 2026-11-15 to a coordinator. COMPLETE 2026-11-15: checklist at ~/workspace/your_files/domain-migration-checklist-2026-11-15.md. Two findings change the 2026-11-06 proposal: (1) NFSN does NOT accept inbound .io or .me transfers (gTLDs + .us only, per its FAQ/price list) — phext.io and visionquest.me registrations stay at GoDaddy; they consolidate as DNS-only at NFSN, or phext.io moves to another at-cost registrar as a separate decision. (2) ALL 8 migrating domains host DNS at their current registrar, so every transfer is gated on a Phase 2B: replicate zone at NFSN, switch nameservers, soak >=48h, verify from a ranch node, then transfer. Six transfers total $84.74; Step 0 deposit ~$200 keeps the ~$100 balance floor. exectorox.com phase 1 before 2026-12-04 (start by 2026-11-24), transfer $14.59 -> expiry 2027-12-25. Transfer order: sotafomo.com pathfinder, quickfork.net, apertureshift.com, wishnode.net, mirrorborn.us last.
