Request (verbatim): also include the wiring diagram with dots for 2.5G Ethernet, WiFi, and USB4 uplinks - SSH accessible from double-clicking on the node
Status: open - spec in W4 plan section 1.11; build dispatched (2026-11-21)

Notes:
- Registered at intake 2026-11-21 23:17 CST (record-first rule). Source of record: wiring.phext (present at ~/workspace/phext/wiring.phext; published wbic16/human@exo). Double-click rides section 1.9 session machinery where present; fallback is the exact fleet SSH command, stated plainly.
# Wikibox live demo — whole English Wikipedia in semantic space, fractally encrypted

