Status: parked by Will's refocus 2026-11-20 19:56 CST — demo/semantic-space/fractal-encryption layer set aside; the design stands as a record (~/workspace/wikibox-scale/DEMO-DESIGN.md). Focus moved to the encoding itself: Wikipedia via multiversal phext with standoff compression.

Notes:
- Will directed 2026-11-20 19:50 CST: rebuild Wikibox as a live demo — all English Wikipedia articles, organized into semantic space, encrypted fractally.
- Extends the Wikibox scale programme; stage work must integrate with ~/workspace/wikibox-scale/STATE.md, not fork a parallel track.
- 2026-11-20 19:56 CST: Will — 'let's just focus on encoding wikipedia via multiversal phext with standoff compression.' Demo open questions (§6) are parked with the task, not answered.
