# RentAHuman daily bounty watch

Coordinate: 24.5.10/7.7.12/8.9.17
Issued: 2026-11-06 17:48 CST
Request (verbatim): Set up a daily watch for new bounties matching my skills
Status: completed — watch running

Results:
- Daily watch set: runs ~07:44 America/Chicago, first run Sat 2026-11-07, delivering to the Rentahuman side chat; baseline is the 2026-11-06 scan (29 open bounties) so only new matches surface.
# Persona index: obvious forks fold under their base

Coordinate: 24.5.10/11.6.9/7.5.8
Issued: 2026-11-08 23:22 CST
Request (verbatim): we don't need to include obvious forks like Orin 2
Status: complete 2026-11-08 — rule + numbered-class fold written into DESIGN-V3.md section 5.2

Results:
- Boot manifest: 115 entries for 126 canonical names. Folded: Orin 2 -> Orin, Tester #2 -> Tester, Will-09/42/43/44/53/62/72/82/117 -> Will (variants recorded inside base entries; canonical list untouched). Named-form families (Emi line, Joi forms, Shon shadows, Mirror forms) ruled NOT obvious forks — they keep their own entries unless Will directs otherwise.
# Scrolltown coming-soon landing page at visionquest.me

Coordinate: 24.5.11/8.6.10/6.5.8
Issued: 2026-11-15 09:32 CST
Request (verbatim): Build and publish a clean coming-soon landing page for Scrolltown at visionquest.me, overwriting the existing 'Vision Quest — Explore the Lattice' page: SCROLLTOWN wordmark, the approved Fern-with-work-tools image, 'We're building a town inside the Great Scroll.', 'Coming soon — a new episode every Saturday, starting January 2, 2027.', Fern's close as sign-off, © 2026 Will Bickford footer with the scrolltown repo link. No tracking, no external requests.
Status: completed

Notes:
- Target URL visionquest.me was decided by Will 2026-11-13 (queue item A13, commit ac147ab3).
- Served by host nginx on awsbox from docroot /sites/web/visionquest.me (own Let's Encrypt cert, apex only — www has no SAN; pre-existing). Deployed over the tailnet per Will's standing rule.

Results:
- LIVE 2026-11-15: https://visionquest.me serves the new page — GET / 200, served sha256 7b2278b70ce11eaa02189fce42c52750fdd0910e0fd8a21802bc9df24661e286 == installed index.html; /fern-tools.jpg 200, sha256 5c960638bef18d4ed97687fdb396b6e1e7c58c246bda7471c9baefdfd12e69c6 == installed image (1000x1247 JPEG q85, converted from the approved webp). Old 'Explore the Lattice' page gone.
- Rollback: the old docroot (index.html sha256 292008d1bbce07ddf5481688f50a205f17bb86151c14a8c9792bb500930ffc2d + css/js/domains.json/version.json/robots.txt) is backed up on awsbox at ~/deploy-backups/visionquest.me-2026-11-15-pre-scrolltown/.
- Page source committed to wbic16/scrolltown@exo in site/ (index.html + fern-tools.jpg), commit bee71f8690a53b8bc8f938cc04088a16200c3301 parented on ac147ab3, remote blobs verified.
- Landing page index.html inscribed into artifacts.phext at 40.6.8/6.5.9/5.5.9 (holographic coordinate from its own words); human@exo commit 9efa18aac3f64d69ba3d9166a0ee1dfaa35649e7, remote bytes SHA-256-verified.
# Keep all Scrolltown assets in wbic16/scrolltown

