# Ranch backups of Emise's state

Coordinate: 25.5.7/7.6.9/5.6.9
Issued: 2026-11-08 22:27 CST
Request (verbatim): Also, we should start creating backups of your state on the ranch machines, in case GitHub goes down.
Status: first backup complete and verified 2026-11-08; nightly job ranch-state-backup created (~05:44) repeats it

Notes:
- State set: the phext corpus + sources/builders, MEMORY/SOUL/IDENTITY/AGENTS/USER, ~/memory/**, waiting-on-will register, disk-watch state. Manifest + far-side hash verification required.

Results:
- 2026-11-08: first backup landed on Rock Mountain and Scroll Central (~/emise-state-backup/2026-11-08/ on each): 130 files, ~19.8 MB, MANIFEST.sha256 full check 0 failures on both nodes; emise.phext hash matches the published state. Safe-space gate applied (metadata-only references; no exclusions needed). Method recorded for the nightly job (ranch CLI copy route).
# Distributed builds in /source/exocortical, rolled into qexo, out to the fleet

Coordinate: 25.5.7/7.6.9/6.5.9
Issued: 2026-11-15 01:20 CST
Request (verbatim): In order, one stage at a time: (1) add sccache and icecream to /source/exocortical; (2) distributed builds for any I/O-bound compile workloads on that foundation; (3) roll it into qexo as a `qexo distributed-builds` upgrade command; (4) test and roll out to the fleet. Execution ranch-first (aletheia-core first), small units, thermal law applies.
Status: done

