# Phextron visibility into every data stash

Coordinate: 25.7.9/8.7.10/7.7.10
Issued: 2026-11-21 19:20 CST
Request (verbatim): Extend the Phextron dashboard program (task 21.4.10/5.5.8/6.4.6): Phextron must have visibility into every place Will has stashed data — not only the phext corpora. First build the stash census: a read-only inventory of every data location across the estate (ranch nodes, awsbox, this VM, SQ hosts, fleet NFS, Choir mailboxes, GitHub, DR/backup repos, neon/lilly, cloud storage), recorded as a phext register (stash.phext, house builder pattern) with per-stash kind, size, freshness, and live read method. Then a Phextron Data panel reads that register; panel stage slots immediately after the all-phexts panel (stage 3) in the dashboard build order.
Status: complete 2026-11-21 — stash.phext census register built and CURRENT (RECON 487ca8df) AND the Phextron Data panel landed (phextron 0d565bb, screenshots 4dfcee2): the panel reads stash.phext live via libphext, renders the Home scroll's totals as written, nests the 13 detail scrolls under their counted parents, shows the 9 unmeasured stashes as GAP rows; verified live + degraded x light + dark, zero console errors

Notes:
- 2026-11-21: Stash census COMPLETE. stash.phext built in ~/workspace/phext (stash-source.json + build_stash_phext.py; --check CURRENT; sha256 4dcd956e20c41fb13b42aab63b5b49f2829b791e44540c7c1593b54f001ef206; SQ-verified parseable). 67 stashes, 1,953,371,966,239 B measured across 45 counted entries; kinds: working trees 27, other 15, phext corpus 6, film & renders 4, backups 4, mailboxes 3, registers 2, media 2, site data 2, repos 2. Surprises: hub chromium-census ~240 GB (largest single stash, previously unrecorded); hub system Ollama store 317.9 GB; ~1.1 TB of hub df-used unattributed by read-only probes (named gap, follow-up = full du of /home/wbic16); orchid-flow exports 6 NFS shares, 3 of them (models/backups/bliss) mounted fleet-wide and empty; GitHub now 242 repos / 5,296,733,184 B. Unenumerated (named with reasons): great-white, aurora-continuum, best-willow, delta-wood, uncanny-valley (live), Neon container corpus, lilly Windows side, Google Drive, ni-knight archive root (concurrent task 30.4.6/5.5.8/4.4.8), 3 nodes' system Ollama stores. STASH section appended to wbic16/phextron docs/RECON.md, commit 487ca8df281edfea627cb1c4f3bc7896fb5c3249 on exo. The Data panel itself is a separate stage.
- 2026-11-21: Data panel COMPLETE — the panel half of this task, so the task completes. wbic16/phextron panel commit 0d565bbb5a4d95ad584f383fff1f29d6599d8b25 (https://github.com/wbic16/phextron/commit/0d565bbb5a4d95ad584f383fff1f29d6599d8b25), screenshots commit 4dfcee26e43aced532df4b22a9d5e201c856fbaa; remote tree verified after push. crates/phextron-dash/src/data.rs reads stash.phext itself via libphext (explode) from the synced snapshot in ~/phextron-data/phext-vm/stash.phext (PHEXTRON_DATA_STASH_PHEXT overrides); the SHA-256 of the register bytes read is computed std-only and shown on the panel's face — verified live against the census build hash 4dcd956e20c41fb13b42aab63b5b49f2829b791e44540c7c1593b54f001ef206. Header totals are rendered from the builder-computed Home scroll as written, never recomputed: 67 stashes recorded, 1,953,371,966,239 bytes (1.95 TB) measured over 45 counted entries. The 13 counted=no detail scrolls nest under their counted parents (Hub home (wbic16); GitHub account (wbic16)) and never enter totals; the 9 unmeasured stashes render as GAP rows with their reasons (Great White, offline nodes, Neon container corpus, Lilly Windows side, Google Drive, ni-knight archive root, Hub unattributed remainder, +2). Re-probe: stat-only, only for hosts declared in PHEXTRON_DATA_LOCAL_HOSTS (paths are host-relative, never guessed) — 11 hub rows stat-refreshed in the proof run on aletheia-core; a failed probe falls back to the register value on the row's face. A missing or Home-less register degrades by name. Verified in headless Chromium on aletheia-core: live + degraded x light + dark, zero console errors (docs/screenshots/data-light.png, data-dark.png, data-degraded-light.png, data-degraded-dark.png). Tests: phextron-dash 39/39, full workspace 49/49, 0 warnings. Register observation: the register is internally consistent (67 parsed = 67 recorded; 9 gaps = 9 unmeasured in Home); the ni-knight archive root entry remains census truth from the 19:32 CST probe, before the archive (task 30.4.6/5.5.8/4.4.8) landed — a re-census is the follow-up; the panel renders the entry as written and does not special-case it.
