Request (verbatim): Enumerate candidate pairings of disciplines; classify which EMF (Exocortical Message Fabric = transaction processing x RF signaling) spans; cluster the remainder into the minimum set of additional spanning frameworks; name all frameworks; then build them with Will, tie into the predictive-swarm process, run the first test.
Status: open - analysis is the next step (Will and Emise together) IaC home designated by Will 2026-11-15 23:28 CST: https://github.com/wbic16/machine-elf — the EMF 128 MB micro-agent instances live there. Repo state at designation: initial commit 921cb47, LICENSE only — the home is named, the IaC build itself has not started.
