- Will, MOAT, 2026-11-10 22:02-22:03 CST. Coordinator dispatched: build contests register mirroring tasks.phext machinery (home scroll = campaign order + buffer policy + deadline board; one scroll per contest in deadline order with internal submit-ready targets 2-7 days ahead of official closes), review wbic16/exo-plan (suggestions to ~/workspace/hackathon-campaign/exo-plan-review.md, no repo changes beyond the publish), publish contests.phext beside todo.phext on exo, hash-verified. A daily deadline-watch cron (owner: the sweep tracked item) is the mechanism that keeps targets hit.
