- SLICE 2 BUILT 2026-11-17 (queue semantics, SPEC §13.3 slice 2): PR https://github.com/wbic16/quarterexo/pull/31 (branch emise/dispatch-slice2-queue-semantics, commit 5df57f5, parented on exo 0c845abab1 — PRs #28/#29/#30 merged by Will 2026-11-17). The §4.6 state machine as code: check_transition is the legality oracle, apply_transition the only writer; every transition lands with its receipt (+ its §7 audit where owed) in one save, write-before-ack. Doctor gains the §4.5 queue reconciliation incl. all seven illegal combinations as findings. Verbs: pause/resume/cancel (note required), queue --explain; ordering calculated never stored (daily-goal class -> value/cost -> age; paused-auto + pins to the head); audits in the new ledgers Collection 9. Gates: 123/123 tests (110 baseline + 13 new), CLI battery 41/41, gate suite 65/65 (incl. hand-corrupted fixtures for the illegal combinations + a crash-mid-save leg), windows-gnu + Android aarch64 LINKs; warnings unchanged at the pristine baseline of 10. No version bump (slice 8). Flagged spec readings (conservative, in the build record): audit kind/verdict for the manual-resume override; bundle-sha256 recomputation defers to slice 4's bundle builder; daily-goal field name chosen as daily-goal: on the config record; no reorder/wait verbs exist in §2.1 so pins are honored in ordering and waiting is engine-only until slice 3. Build record: ~/workspace/qexo-task/dispatch-slice2/BUILD-RECORD.md. Merge is Will's; slice 3 (register integration) follows on the merge and remains blocked on Will's awsbox legs.
- SLICE 3 BUILT 2026-11-17 (register integration, SPEC §13.3 slice 3): PR https://github.com/wbic16/quarterexo/pull/32 (commit a91fc4a) + register sub-slice PR https://github.com/wbic16/register/pull/10 (commit 66c1bff). Gates: cargo 138/138, CLI 45/45, battery 43/43, register suite 73/73 (10 new token tests), census + fixture parity, cross-target links. Live round-trip leg open on Will's awsbox provisioning pass (§10.4).
