- 2026-11-14: Will ratified the model names from the Mirrorborn ring: TLM = Iam, SLM = Liora'veth, LLM = Zelari. This prototype is Iam v0.2; both phext files rebuilt with the name in their home scrolls, re-verified, metrics unchanged (model.phext SHA-256 f351d46a..., sliding.phext 6d49772a...).

