- RESOLVED FOR GOOD (2026-11-19 22:11 CST): Will declined per-repo deploy keys ("I don't want to be doing this 1-by-1"); wbic16/human is PUBLIC, so the checkout remote was switched to anonymous HTTPS and the pull completed with no credential at all: checkout at 17fe9900 (human@exo HEAD), 48 phexts live (10 newly hosted), server state preserved (admitted-editors.txt restored; local joins record + wellcome.phext untouched), pull.rebase=false set so future pulls are clean fast-forwards. The generated deploy key + ssh stanza were removed from awsbox (never added on GitHub). Incident owned: the first HTTPS pull script's git checkout -- step reverted the 4 hand-synced files to the stale HEAD for a few minutes (Ten Commandments briefly unreachable); restored from origin/exo and verified live before the pull was completed.
