# Keep wbic16/qexo (Android APK) and wbic16/quarterexo (Linux/Windows) synced

Coordinate: 29.6.7/6.5.7/6.5.8
Issued: 2026-11-14 02:08 CST
Request (from session record): Will (2026-11-14 02:08 CST): 'make sure you keep the qexo (android apk) and quarterexo (linux/windows) repos synced.' Standing rule for the two qexo repos: they are one product on two homes — shared code changes land in BOTH; neither repo is allowed to drift silently behind the other. quarterexo is the main line (Linux/Windows, crates.io); wbic16/qexo carries the Android port + APK packaging. Android-specific deltas (state-path fallback, timer truth, APK packaging per the apk-publishing guideline) are preserved through every sync, and anything Android-born that generalizes (as the state-path fallback generalized into per-user installs in v1.4.0) flows back to quarterexo. Every sync is a PR in the receiving repo, never a silent copy.
Status: SYNCED at v1.6.1 content in both repos 2026-11-14 — learn --app twin merged (quarterexo PR #24), phccbox roster merged both sides; standing sync rule remains for future changes

Notes:
- SYNC DEBT as of 2026-11-14 02:08 CST: wbic16/qexo sits at the PR #1 lineage (source descends from quarterexo v1.2.0 @ 833e2f34, stamped 1.3.0, OLD hand-rolled parser). quarterexo has since shipped: libphext 0.6 parser (v1.3.0), v1.4.0 (per-user state, nav tree, hostnames, learn, inventory), v1.4.1/v1.4.2 (state top-up + post-check repair). The catch-up PR for wbic16/qexo — carrying quarterexo current (and v1.5 if merged by then) with Android deltas preserved — queues after Will's PR #1 merge verifies (#91) and after the v1.5 PR, one stage at a time; the internal-GPG change (34.7.8/8.6.9/5.6.10) rides that same next-PR channel per Will's 01:50 direction.
- CATCH-UP DELIVERED 2026-11-14 (Phase B): wbic16/qexo PR #2 (emise/android-catchup-v1.6.0 @ ee57d460, parented on its exo e92f69ab) — FOR WILL'S REVIEW, register #106. The Android repo's tree is now quarterexo v1.6.0 (PR #22 there) wholesale: v1.3.0 libphext parser, v1.4.0 per-user/nav-tree/hostnames/learn/inventory, v1.4.1/v1.4.2 top-up + repair, v1.5.0 wizard, v1.6.0 internal OpenPGP; Cargo.lock now carried in both repos. Android deltas: timer truth re-applied verbatim (cfg android in install_update_timer); state-path fallback preserved in its v1.4.0 generalized per-user form (the Android-born generalization that already flowed back); the port's v1.3.0 ship notes preserved in SHIP-NOTES.md. PR body enumerates contents version by version and records that app icons are still owed per the apk-publishing guideline (none fabricated). Gates: cargo test 88/88, battery 16/16, Android aarch64 LINK (sha256 73156eaf...), Linux build, census identical 15/830/2. Status: sync debt closed pending Will's merge of PR #2 (and PR #22 in quarterexo); the standing sync rule itself remains in force for future changes.
