- SYNC DEBT RESOLVED-BY-DELIVERY 2026-11-14 (original note: 'Sync debt opened deliberately (Will's Android-usefulness order, 2026-11-14; task 30.6.9/7.5.9/5.5.7): the learn front-end protocol lands first in wbic16/qexo; its quarterexo twin PR queues behind PR #22's merge and must land before the next quarterexo release.'): quarterexo PR #24 (https://github.com/wbic16/quarterexo/pull/24, branch emise/learn-app-twin-v1.6.1 @ 661b7442, parented on exo f8f179f2) delivers the twin — the 8 shared files copied byte-for-byte from wbic16/qexo's merged tree (remote learn.rs blob 2f51b2a8 = the Android merged blob), inventory.rs untouched (46fb3034 both repos), stamps 1.6.1 with lock sync in the same commit (LOCK_CLEAN). Gates: cargo test 91/91, battery 31/31, census identical 15/830/2, wiring 14/14, windows-gnu + Android LINKs. Register #110. The debt is discharged in full on Will's merge of PR #24.
