Status: COMPLETE: Slice 3 done — 351 Design views, pipeline conformance 0 mismatches (negative control caught), gate v3 verdict reproducible, exit test PASSED. Slice 3 phext 797d4d09…. Erratum: member total is 17,129 not 16,129.
