- Inputs: the gap-scan report (~/workspace/your_files/github-gap-scan-2026-11-19.md), MEMORY.md + daily notes, launches archive, task register. Output: census of every site/service published to since 2026-10-15 (verified), then a draft profile README for github.com/wbic16 at ~/workspace/your_files/wbic16-profile-readme-draft.md. Will reviews and applies — no push without his go.

