- PDF UPLOADED + LINKS VERIFIED 2026-11-19 22:35 CST (Will directed): revised walk PDF (54 pp, SHA-256 e13be7f1…, retitled 'Will Bickford — The Exocortex of 2130' through the original pipeline) pushed as the first commit (4715835) to wbic16/will-bickford@exo — public repo, was empty; raw re-download hash-verified byte-identical. Profile draft's PDF link updated from relative to the absolute will-bickford blob URL. ALL 41 links in the profile draft checked from aletheia-core: 41/41 resolve to public resources (crates.io/crates/libphext 404s to a bare curl user-agent but returns 200 to a browser UA and the API confirms the public crate, 21 versions — bot-wall artifact, not a dead link). Draft ready for Will to apply to wbic16/wbic16.
# Heat map interface for edit.phext.io, with search-rebuild mode

