Coordinate: 32.9.13/7.5.8/6.4.8
Issued: 2026-11-19 01:37 CST
Request (verbatim): polish: the progress bar should be larger, and appear above the buttons
Status: closed — SHIPPED 2026-11-19 05:45:21 CST as phext-lattice PR #85 (merged, 421f13ff); cast (progress) bar now 520x22 above the buttons; launch archived

Notes:
- Scope: the Scrollspace viewer’s progress bar (the loading/progress indicator by the controls) becomes larger and is positioned ABOVE the buttons. Pure presentational polish; no behaviour change. The build identifies the exact bar element in the current page and states before/after placement in its report.
- CLOSED 2026-11-19: PR #85 https://github.com/wbic16/phext-lattice/pull/85 merged to exo (421f13fffde41f9eb2fa11c81d623e05dc536f71). The progress bar is the cast bar (#castwrap/#castbar/#castfill). CSS only: bar 340x12 -> 520x22 (2.8x area), label 12px -> 14px, wrap bottom 128px -> 196px (18px above the button stack top edge at 178px); on-plane lift calc(128px + planefoot-h) -> calc(196px + planefoot-h). Measured before (walk13, production page): 340x12, offset 128px (180 on-plane), gap above bars -50.0px at every cast. After: 520x22, offset 196px, gap +18.0px at every cast (ultra entry, zoom out, L0->L1, L1->L2, L2->L3, L3->L4); on-plane step-back offset 248px = 196 + 52 footer, no footer overlap. The bar renders only during casts (zooms at every level + crumb returns); no boot/loading progress bar exists (display:none through boot, verified). Gate green-equivalent (bin 114/0 incl. pinning test scrollspace_progress_bar_is_large_and_above_the_buttons; only the pre-existing e2e_local timing failure; baseline real_phext timing flake passed on the branch run). Regressions walk3-12 + layout + continuity (0 off-screen) all pass; walk7 anonymous edit refused on the OAuth-locked instance. Deploy MainPID 3931624 -> 3938794; page 87,075 B sha256 b9b62511e082efde9d5548eea31beb9bf0390ec1388982a04f21ec0cb6f87293. SHIP TIMESTAMP 2026-11-19 05:45:21 CST. Live screen test (screen14) ALL PASS. Launch archive: ~/workspace/launches/2026-11-19-0545-progress-bar-polish/. Inscription at artifacts.phext 34.6.7/7.6.10/6.6.10 refreshed, pushed to wbic16/human@exo commit 9d0e3f6e, remote bytes verified.
