- 2026-11-21 03:44 CST: nightly sync (exit 20) found upstream argimenes/mutable-os main moved db3ed30 -> 2f65fd9c (19 commits, 351 files drift); phext-band trial rebase conflicts in scripts/build-sqlite-foundation.mjs only. Overlap files: scripts/build-sqlite-foundation.mjs, server/cavern-lifecycle.ts, server/managed-assets.test.mjs, src/configuration.ts, src/knowledge-sqlite/foundation.test.mjs, src/persistence/native-session.test.ts. SSO band overlap: none. Phext support not upstream yet.
