Status: closed — SHIPPED 2026-11-19 02:27:05 CST as phext-lattice PR #80 (merged, e500e944); Willbot Mono live on all three jumped-to text surfaces; launch archived

Notes:
- Defect (Will, live): after jumping into a page of text (the jumped-to scroll text view — editor scroll page and/or Scrollspace Read surface; the build identifies exactly which surfaces carry the bad font stack), the scroll text is unreadable: the font is weird and the kerning is bad ("kernel" in Will’s message read as kerning).
- Fix direction (Will): use willbot-mono for the jumped-to scroll text. The build locates the willbot-mono font asset in Will’s estate (repo/web assets) and wires it as the text font on the affected surfaces with sane fallbacks; if the asset cannot be found in the estate, the build reports that plainly instead of substituting silently.
- Verification includes a before/after screenshot of a real scroll’s text page, eyeballed for legibility and even kerning.
- Font asset located (Emise, 2026-11-19): WillbotMono ships from Will’s font project — ~/workspace/willbot-font/out/WillbotMono.woff2 (web-ready) and WillbotMono.otf; the face was already bundled once for the Notepad++ phext fork (PowerEditor/src/phext/fonts/). The build should serve the woff2 from the phext-lattice web assets (or the editor’s static route) and name the family consistently with the estate ("WillbotMono" / willbot-mono per Will’s wording).
- CLOSED 2026-11-19: PR #80 https://github.com/wbic16/phext-lattice/pull/80 merged to exo (e500e944fea526ff79ee0329cb96537b9820b8af). Surfaces: editor #content, editor textarea, Scrollspace Read panel #read .body — all now Willbot Mono first (plane GLYPH_FONTS untouched). Font served as /willbot-mono.woff2 (25,428 B, byte-identical to ~/workspace/willbot-font/out/WillbotMono.woff2) on the pre-gate static route; @font-face family "Willbot Mono". Proof of load: canvas width probe 440.0 vs 529.8 fallback + document.fonts loaded + computed styles on Glassfruit and a dense 22,919-char emise.phext scroll. Gate green-equivalent (bin 109/0, +1 pinning test). Deploy MainPID 3889162 -> 3893979. New page 58,155 B sha256 2a8f930c927532029b07f45a17b8e518f63d016f2190ccbaa286dbeb16951245. SHIP TIMESTAMP 2026-11-19 02:27:05 CST. Launch archive: ~/workspace/launches/2026-11-19-0227-willbot-mono-text/. Honest note flagged to Will: Willbot Mono is handwriting-derived — W and 0 are hand-drawn forms (faithful to the font as designed, even mono spacing); his call if it reads wrong.
