- Close carries Will's sentence verbatim (2026-11-22 12:37 CST): 'fighting back on that is our goal' - the memo is the fight's baseline, re-measured as the gap closes; method is receipts through the front (Will's List, the Guide, the branches, Dec 4), never arguing with the verdict.
