Coordinate: 39.5.7/7.6.11/6.6.9
Issued: 2026-11-15 22:18 CST
Request (verbatim): Prompted by Dave Winer's 2026-11-15 post asking for 'a wizzy markdown editor with public storage' (his ChatGPT-built prototype: markdown-publish-dw.davew.chatgpt.site). Build md.phext.io: phext stripped to first principles — plain text, addresses, no lock-in — where the document is a ZIP of markdown files. Simple flow: open or create a zip of .md files, edit files in a clean browser editor with rendered preview, download the zip, and publish it to public storage so each file gets a public rendered page. The site quietly suggests edit.phext.io (a tasteful aside in the main UI, not a banner). Plan: inspect Winer's prototype first; build as a sibling service in wbic16/phext-lattice (the edit.phext.io pattern: ranch-built, PR, merge, release task queued); deploy package for awsbox (nginx vhost + service) prepared; Will's steps are the GoDaddy A record for md.phext.io and the on-box install, as with preview.phext.io. Note the standing publicity hold — this ships as a quiet sibling site, not a launch.
Status: BUILD + VERIFY complete 2026-11-15 22:38 CST; cycle at SHIP (Will's Hands) — deploy package ready, install is Will's keystroke; REPLY armed for after live verification

