# Push and proceed, round 2: consolidate phext lineages, publish to wbic16/phcc

Coordinate: 39.7.9/6.5.8/4.4.9
Issued: 2026-11-07
Request (from session record): push and proceed
Status: COMPLETE

Notes:
- Consolidation + both pushes completed 2026-11-07; see phcc-consolidated/REPORT.md.

Results:
- Consolidation PROVEN by full scroll-set diff: non-Vol-3 1,952 scrolls = lineage A byte-identical (0 missing/extra/differing); Vol 3 50,828 scrolls = lineage B (0/0/0); A Vol 3 coords a strict subset of B (25,647 common, 319 refined, 25,181 B-only, 0 A-only). Design views regenerated over v4 members (extract_design.py unmodified): 351 views - 196 byte-identical, 109 changed = exactly importer v4 files_rebuilt set, 46 changed by name-universe growth only, 0 other; pipeline view byte-identical, check_pipeline PASS (17 names/16 edges/0 mismatches); gap-recovered types 723 -> 2. Consolidation provenance scroll at Meta 1.1.1/1.2.10/1.11.1. Gate v4 re-run: stdout tables byte-identical to lineage A baseline (Design 351/351 current 0 STALE; receipts CURRENT; machine static PASS live, dynamic 16/16 + 24/24, binding CURRENT, 4 regressions); verdict sha256 47b7b8be8fea46c79f62370248647f6be7faf6aa947c2f636476a6e24c9e51d8, byte-reproducible (whole-file re-run identical). Canonical phcc.phext: 43,975,346 B, 52,781 scrolls, sha256 61638c143338ad942783a11141a0f1be3f66e522d4a15880b8301d2afbaa1b4f. Exit checks: reassembly 558/558 byte-identical; ranch build+test ALL TESTS PASSED. PUSHED to wbic16/phcc: additive commit 5cd3ad917002559db122b22c041209a732b1724e (phcc.phext + tools/, scripts 100755) on exo, main fast-forwarded, fresh-clone verified (sha match, modes, make test pass). Then per Will's follow-on ruling, deletion commit 4f974464d60a2116ace53207b5a2dea8a4622cca removed monolith.phext (need-check: not a build input - no build file references it; 319/319 scrolls preserved byte-identical at same coordinates in phcc.phext Vol 1); exo+main fast-forwarded; fresh clone verifies monolith absent, phext sha match, make test pass. Final tips: main = exo = 4f974464; backup branch emise/pre-slice0-2026-11-07 still at 1b102067. Report: ~/workspace/phcc-consolidated/REPORT.md.
# Configure the phext-lattice sync chain: libphext-rs → holo-phext → phext-lattice

