- 2026-11-17 sweep done: 18 open PRs enumerated estate-wide (GitHub search API vs site map); Mirror Will (rehearsal tier, capsule v4, boot intent contract) reviewed all 18 from the diffs in one session. Ledger: ~/workspace/pr-reviews/LEDGER.md (internal only; nothing posted to GitHub, no repo state changed). Verdicts: MERGE x8 (register #10, quarterexo #32, phextio #1, notepad-plus-plus #1, register #9, libphext-rs #14, the-book-of-secret-knowledge #1, phext-shell #3), FIX-FIRST x1 (phext-lattice #70), HOLD x9 (libphext-rs #15, holostore #1/#2, human #12, vtpu #2/#9, exocortical #3, libphext-rs #1, rfb001 #1). Urgent flags: (1) register #9/#10 do not compose — owner-only close vs qexo uid makes write-backs 404; merge #9 first, rebase #10 with the scope-owner check for the qexo path. (2) libphext-rs #14 merge-order: phext-lattice #70 and holostore #2 pin libphext 0.6.2 git rev af3867c from #14's unmerged branch. (3) phextio #1 essays.html links seeds/essays.phext, not in the diff — verify it resolves or the Essays archive is a live 404.
